@startuml membership-statechart
' Bootstrap draft, GenAI prompt #6 and #7. Report §6. Transitions: event [guard] / action.
!include ../style.iuml
hide empty description

[*] --> Trial : signUp(plan)
Trial --> Active : trialEnds [paid]
Active --> Frozen : freeze(m) [m <= 3] / extendEnd(m)
Frozen --> Active : unfreeze()
Active --> Lapsed : paymentFailed [2nd in a row]
Lapsed --> Active : payArrears()
Active --> Cancelled : cancel() / finalBill()
Cancelled --> [*]
@enduml
